Brazilian company part of the SAT Group, founded in 1985 with structure and know-how for development, manufacturing, installation, maintenance, technical assistance and supply of parts aimed at:
  - Storage, distribution and supply of fluids;
  - Testing and supply machines;
  - Lubricant application processes such as greases, oils;
  - Glass bonding processes and sub-assemblies such as sunroof, truck roof, among others;
  - Chassis recording in different capacities and levels of automation;
  - Various quality control tests for sub-sets.
Today, Engemo is a member of the SAT Sterling Group, with business units SAT Germany and NKE Italy, as well as a technical and commercial presence on several continents.
